        slug: 'misiles-norcoreanos-zaporiyia',
        titleEs: 'Zelenski denuncia un ataque ruso con misiles norcoreanos que deja 6 muertos en Zaporiyia',
        titleEn: 'Zelensky denounces a Russian attack with North Korean missiles that kills 6 in Zaporizhzhia',
        excerptEs: 'El presidente de Ucrania alertÃ³ del aumento de los lazos militares entre MoscÃº y Pionyang, mientras pide a Occidente mÃ¡s defensa aÃ©rea.',
        excerptEn: 'Ukraine\'s president warned of growing military ties between Moscow and Pyongyang while asking the West for more air defenses.',
        contentEs: `<h1>Zelenski denuncia un ataque ruso con misiles norcoreanos que deja 6 muertos en Zaporiyia</h1><p><em>El presidente ucraniano VolodÃ­mir Zelenski afirmÃ³ que Rusia disparÃ³ misiles norcoreanos en un ataque nocturno que causÃ³ seis muertos y dejÃ³ 19 heridos en la ciudad suroriental.</em></p><p>El presidente ucraniano VolodÃ­mir Zelenski afirmÃ³ el martes que Rusia disparÃ³ misiles norcoreanos en un ataque nocturno que causÃ³ seis muertos y dejÃ³ 19 heridos en la ciudad suroriental de Zaporiyia.</p><p>"La ciudad fue atacada con misiles balÃ­sticos norcoreanos, Zircon y bombas aÃ©reas guiadas", dijo, en referencia a los misiles de crucero hipersÃ³nicos rusos Zircon.</p><h2>CooperaciÃ³n militar MoscÃº-Pionyang</h2><p>Zelenski habÃ­a advertido la noche anterior de que Rusia se preparaba para desplegar mÃ¡s tropas norcoreanas en su territorio y que ya habÃ­a recibido mÃ¡s misiles balÃ­sticos de Pionyang. Ha alertado en repetidas ocasiones del creciente acercamiento militar entre MoscÃº y Pionyang, a menudo mientras reclama mÃ¡s suministros occidentales de defensa aÃ©rea.</p><p>En Zaporiyia, el jefe de la administraciÃ³n militar regional, Ivan Fedorov, informÃ³ que las fuerzas rusas lanzaron un ataque "masivo" con misiles y bombas aÃ©reas guiadas y actualizÃ³ el balance a seis muertos y 19 heridos. En la regiÃ³n de Dnipropetrovsk, los ataques con drones y artillerÃ­a causaron tres muertes mÃ¡s.</p><h2>Un pacto de defensa mutua</h2><p>Corea del Norte se ha convertido en uno de los socios militares mÃ¡s estrechos de Rusia desde que el presidente ruso VladÃ­mir Putin y el lÃ­der norcoreano Kim Jong Un firmaron un pacto de defensa mutua en junio de 2024. MoscÃº utilizÃ³ ademÃ¡s tropas norcoreanas en una contraofensiva a finales de ese mismo aÃ±o.</p><p><small>Con informaciÃ³n de: <a href="https://es.euronews.com/2026/08/11/zelenski-denuncia-un-ataque-ruso-con-misiles-norcoreanos-que-deja-6-muertos-en-zaporiyia">Euronews</a></small></p>`,
        contentEn: `<h1>Zelensky denounces a Russian attack with North Korean missiles that kills 6 in Zaporizhzhia</h1><p><em>Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky said Russia fired North Korean missiles in an overnight attack that killed six people and left 19 wounded in the southeastern city.</em></p><p>Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky said on Tuesday that Russia fired North Korean missiles in an overnight attack that killed six people and left 19 wounded in the southeastern city of Zaporizhzhia.</p><p>"The city was attacked with North Korean ballistic missiles, Zircon and guided air bombs," he said, referring to Russia's hypersonic Zircon cruise missiles.</p><h2>Moscow-Pyongyang military cooperation</h2><p>The previous night Zelensky warned that Russia was preparing to deploy more North Korean troops on its territory and had already received more ballistic missiles from Pyongyang. He has repeatedly warned of the growing military rapprochement between Moscow and Pyongyang, often while calling for more Western air defense supplies.</p><p>In Zaporizhzhia, the head of the regional military administration, Ivan Fedorov, reported that Russian forces launched a "massive" attack with missiles and guided air bombs, updating the toll to six dead and 19 wounded. In the Dnipropetrovsk region, drone and artillery attacks caused three more deaths.</p><h2>A mutual defense pact</h2><p>North Korea has become one of Russia's closest military partners since Russian President Vladimir Putin and North Korean leader Kim Jong Un signed a mutual defense pact in June 2024. Moscow also used North Korean troops in a counteroffensive at the end of that year.</p><p><small>Source: <a href="https://es.euronews.com/2026/08/11/zelenski-denuncia-un-ataque-ruso-con-misiles-norcoreanos-que-deja-6-muertos-en-zaporiyia">Euronews</a></small></p>`,
        date: '2026-08-11',
        readTimeEs: '5 min de lectura',
        readTimeEn: '4 min read',
        imageUrl: '/images/news/2026-08-13-misiles-norcoreanos.jpg',
        imageCaption: 'Bomberos trabajan para extinguir un incendio tras un ataque aÃ©reo ruso sobre Zaporiyia. Imagen: @ZelenskyyUa',
        categoryEs: 'Conflictos',
        categoryEn: 'Conflicts',
        enableComments: true,
        featured: true,
        breaking: false,
        views: 1,
        location: 'Zaporiyia, Ucrania',
        source: 'EURONEWS',
        region: 'International',
        sourceUrl: 'https://es.euronews.com/2026/08/11/zelenski-denuncia-un-ataque-ruso-con-misiles-norcoreanos-que-deja-6-muertos-en-zaporiyia'
