        id: '1018',
        contentType: 'news',
        slug: 'archivos-fbi-swalwell-fang-fang-china',
        titleEs: 'Archivos del FBI desclasificados revelan la relaciÃ³n de Swalwell con una supuesta operativa china',
        titleEn: 'Declassified FBI files reveal Swalwell\'s relationship with a suspected Chinese operative',
        excerptEs: 'Documentos divulgados por la Casa Blanca muestran que el excongresista Eric Swalwell admitiÃ³ al FBI en 2015 haber tenido relaciones fÃ­sicas con Christine Fang, investigada como posible agente de la inteligencia china.',
        excerptEn: 'Documents released by the White House show former Rep. Eric Swalwell told the FBI in 2015 he had a physical relationship with Christine Fang, suspected of being a Chinese intelligence operative.',
        contentEs: '<h1>Archivos del FBI desclasificados revelan la relaciÃ³n de Swalwell con una supuesta operativa china</h1><p><em>Documentos del FBI desclasificados y publicados este lunes por el grupo de trabajo de transparencia de la Casa Blanca revelan que el exrepresentante Eric Swalwell admitiÃ³ a los investigadores en 2015 haber mantenido relaciones fÃ­sicas con Christine Fang, la supuesta operativa china en el centro de una investigaciÃ³n de contrainteligencia de aÃ±os.</em></p><p>SegÃºn los resÃºmenes de entrevistas del FBI, Swalwell dijo a los agentes en mayo de 2015 que tuvo relaciones con Fang "en un puÃ±ado de ocasiones", aunque asegurÃ³ que nunca salieron ni tuvieron una relaciÃ³n romÃ¡ntica. Uno de los episodios involucrÃ³ la llegada sorpresiva de Fang a su apartamento en una noche que Swalwell dijo "apenas recordar" por el consumo previo de un medicamento.</p><h2>QuiÃ©n es Christine Fang</h2><p>Fang, tambiÃ©n conocida como "Fang Fang", es una ciudadana china que llegÃ³ a Estados Unidos alrededor de 2011 para estudiar en la Universidad Estatal de California en East Bay y que, segÃºn los servicios de contrainteligencia, cultivÃ³ vÃ­nculos con polÃ­ticos estadounidenses en ascenso mediante financiaciÃ³n y relaciones personales. Un informe de Axios de 2020 destapÃ³ sus conexiones con figuras demÃ³cratas, incluido Swalwell.</p><h2>La investigaciÃ³n "Freshman Fifteen"</h2><p>Los expedientes detallan una pesquisa de corrupciÃ³n pÃºblica, conocida como "Freshman Fifteen", que examinÃ³ mÃ¡s de 1,1 millones de dÃ³lares en contribuciones a la primera campaÃ±a al Congreso de Swalwell y posibles donaciones de terceros o de extranjeros a cambio de pasantÃ­as en su oficina. Un memorando de 2017 concluyÃ³ que no se hallaron violaciones de las leyes federales de corrupciÃ³n por parte de Swalwell y que no hubo pruebas de un intercambio de favores; el caso fue reencuadrado para centrarse en Fang. La fiscalÃ­a finalmente no presentÃ³ cargos y Fang abandonÃ³ Estados Unidos en 2015.</p><h2>Reacciones</h2><p>La abogada de Swalwell, Sara Azari, criticÃ³ la divulgaciÃ³n y hablÃ³ de un "uso de informaciÃ³n de la aplicaciÃ³n de la ley federal para castigar a un crÃ­tico abierto de la administraciÃ³n actual". Swalwell, que renunciÃ³ al Congreso en abril y abandonÃ³ su campaÃ±a para gobernador de California por acusaciones de conducta sexual inapropiada â€”que niegaâ€”, no fue acusado de delito en esta investigaciÃ³n.</p><p><small>Con informaciÃ³n de: <a href="https://abc7news.com/post/new-fbi-files-reveal-former-rep-eric-swalwell-admitted-relationship-suspected-chinese-operative-christine-fang/19694681/">ABC7 News (KGO)</a></small></p>',
        contentEn: '<h1>Declassified FBI files reveal Swalwell\'s relationship with a suspected Chinese operative</h1><p><em>Newly declassified FBI documents released Monday by the White House transparency task force reveal that former Rep. Eric Swalwell told investigators he had a physical relationship with Christine Fang, the suspected Chinese operative at the center of a yearslong counterintelligence investigation.</em></p><p>According to FBI interview summaries, Swalwell told agents in May 2015 that he had physical relations with Fang "on a handful of occasions," though he said he never dated her or had a romantic relationship. One episode involved Fang arriving unannounced at his apartment on a night Swalwell said he "barely remembers" because he had taken medication beforehand.</p><h2>Who is Christine Fang</h2><p>Fang, also known as "Fang Fang," is a Chinese national who moved to the United States around 2011 to study at California State University, East Bay, and who allegedly cultivated relationships with rising American politicians through fundraising and personal ties. A 2020 Axios investigation exposed her connections to Democratic figures, including Swalwell.</p><h2>The "Freshman Fifteen" investigation</h2><p>The files detail a public corruption probe, known as "Freshman Fifteen," that examined more than $1.1 million in contributions to Swalwell\'s first congressional campaign and possible third-party or foreign donations in exchange for internships in his office. A 2017 memorandum found that investigators had not found violations of federal corruption statutes by Swalwell and that there was no evidence of a quid pro quo; the case was retitled to focus on Fang. Prosecutors ultimately declined to bring charges, and Fang left the United States in 2015.</p><h2>Reactions</h2><p>Swalwell\'s attorney, Sara Azari, criticized the release, citing the "use of federal law enforcement information to punish an outspoken critic of the current administration." Swalwell, who resigned from Congress in April and ended his California gubernatorial campaign over sexual misconduct allegations he denies, was never charged in this investigation.</p><p><small>Source: <a href="https://abc7news.com/post/new-fbi-files-reveal-former-rep-eric-swalwell-admitted-relationship-suspected-chinese-operative-christine-fang/19694681/">ABC7 News (KGO)</a></small></p>',
        date: '2026-08-18',
        readTimeEs: '6 min de lectura',
        readTimeEn: '5 min read',
        imageUrl: '/images/blog/us-news/swalwell-fbi-fang.jpg',
        imageCaption: 'Eric Swalwell y Christine Fang en una imagen dividida de archivo. Foto: ABC7 News',
        categoryEs: 'PolÃ­tica',
        categoryEn: 'Politics',
        enableComments: true,
        featured: false,
        breaking: false,
        views: 1,
        location: 'Washington D.C., Estados Unidos',
        source: 'ABC7 News',
        region: 'US',
        sourceUrl: 'https://abc7news.com/post/new-fbi-files-reveal-former-rep-eric-swalwell-admitted-relationship-suspected-chinese-operative-christine-fang/19694681/'
