    contentEs: `<p class="lead"><em>El presidente de Estados Unidos amenazÃ³ el 25 de agosto de 2026 con imponer nuevos aranceles a CanadÃ¡, en una escalada de tensiÃ³n comercial reportada por <em>Democracy Now</em>.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="/images/blog/eeuu-canada-nuevos-aranceles-trump-25-agosto-2026.jpg" alt="Cruce fronterizo EE. UU.-Canada." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Cruce fronterizo EE. UU.-Canada.</figcaption></figure><p>En el frente interno, el congresista Al Green presentÃ³ artÃ­culos de impeachment relacionados con la campaÃ±a de deportaciones, mientras la jueza Ketanji Brown Jackson advirtiÃ³ sobre el "caos" que generarÃ­an las decisiones de la Corte Suprema en las elecciones de medio mandato.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#ff8000">R</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">Reuters <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@Reuters</div><p class="tweet-text">Trump threatens further tariffs on Canada as domestic political pressure mounts over immigration and midterm legal fights.</p><div class="tweet-meta">25 ago 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/Reuters" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>La amenaza llega en un momento de fragilidad en la relaciÃ³n bilateral, con CanadÃ¡ preparando represalias si se concretan los gravÃ¡menes.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">25 ago 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Amenaza arancelaria</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Al Green</div><div class="stat-label">ArtÃ­culos de impeachment</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Jackson</div><div class="stat-label">Advertencia en la Corte</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Medio mandato</div><div class="stat-label">Elecciones en juego</div></div></div><p>Los mercados reaccionaron con cautela ante la posibilidad de una nueva guerra comercial regional.</p><p>Con informaciÃ³n de: Democracy Now y Reuters.</p>`,
    contentEn: `<p class="lead"><em>The US president threatened on 25 August 2026 to impose fresh tariffs on Canada, in an escalation of trade tension reported by <em>Democracy Now</em>.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493711662062-fa541adb3fc8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70" alt="North American commerce (illustrative image)." loading="lazy"><figcaption>North American commerce (illustrative image).</figcaption></figure><p>On the domestic front, Rep. Al Green filed articles of impeachment tied to the deportation campaign, while Justice Ketanji Brown Jackson warned of the "chaos" from Supreme Court decisions around the midterms.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#ff8000">R</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">Reuters <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@Reuters</div><p class="tweet-text">Trump threatens further tariffs on Canada as domestic political pressure mounts over immigration and midterm legal fights.</p><div class="tweet-meta">Aug 25 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/Reuters" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>The threat comes as the bilateral relationship is fragile, with Canada preparing retaliation if the levies materialise.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Aug 25 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Tariff threat</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Al Green</div><div class="stat-label">Impeachment articles</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Jackson</div><div class="stat-label">Court warning</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Midterms</div><div class="stat-label">Elections at stake</div></div></div><p>Markets reacted cautiously to the prospect of a new regional trade war.</p><p>With information from: Democracy Now and Reuters.</p>`,
    date: '2026-08-25',
    readTimeEs: '5 min',
    readTimeEn: '5 min',
    imageUrl: '/images/blog/eeuu-canada-nuevos-aranceles-trump-25-agosto-2026.jpg',
    imageCaption: 'Cruce fronterizo entre EE. UU. y Canada (Blaine, WA - White Rock, BC). Fuente: Wikimedia Commons.',
    categoryEs: 'EconomÃ­a',
