    slug: 'reino-unido-chagos-burnham-primer-ministro-2026',
    titleEs: `Reino Unido: Burnham asume como primer ministro y hereda el conflicto de Chagos`,
    titleEn: `UK: Burnham becomes PM and inherits the Chagos dispute`,
    excerptEs: `Andy Burnham llegÃ³ a Downing Street el 20 de julio de 2026; su primer desafÃ­o es el estatus del archipiÃ©lago de Chagos y la base EE. UU.-Reino Unido.`,
    excerptEn: `Andy Burnham reached Downing Street on 20 July 2026; his first challenge is the Chagos status and the US-UK base.`,
    contentEs: `<p class="lead"><em>Andy Burnham asumiÃ³ como primer ministro del Reino Unido el 20 de julio de 2026, reemplazando a Keir Starmer al frente del Partido Laborista, segÃºn reportes de <em>SCMP</em> y Reuters.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="/images/blog/reino-unido-chagos-burnham-primer-ministro-2026.jpg" alt="Andy Burnham." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Andy Burnham.</figcaption></figure><p>Uno de sus primeros desafÃ­os es el estatus del archipiÃ©lago de Chagos y la base conjunta de EE. UU. y Reino Unido, cuya resoluciÃ³n sigue sin cerrarse y genera fricciones con Washington por temores sobre la influencia china en el Ãndico.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#bb1919">B</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">BBC World <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@BBCWorld</div><p class="tweet-text">Andy Burnham becomes UK PM, facing early pressure over the unresolved Chagos base deal and US-China tensions in the Indian Ocean.</p><div class="tweet-meta">25 ago 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/BBCWorld" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>El nuevo gabinete prometiÃ³ priorizar la economÃ­a y la vivienda, pero la polÃ­tica exterior ya ocupa la agenda.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">20 jul 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Burnham asume</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Starmer</div><div class="stat-label">Predecesor (Labour)</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Chagos</div><div class="stat-label">Primer desafÃ­o</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">EE. UU.-RU</div><div class="stat-label">Base en disputa</div></div></div><p>Analistas seÃ±alan que la decisiÃ³n sobre Chagos definirÃ¡ la relaciÃ³n del Reino Unido con la administraciÃ³n estadounidense.</p><p>Con informaciÃ³n de: SCMP y Reuters.</p>`,
    contentEn: `<p class="lead"><em>Andy Burnham became UK prime minister on 20 July 2026, replacing Keir Starmer as Labour leader, according to <em>SCMP</em> and Reuters reporting.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70" alt="London, seat of the British government (illustrative image)." loading="lazy"><figcaption>London, seat of the British government (illustrative image).</figcaption></figure><p>One of his early challenges is the status of the Chagos archipelago and the joint US-UK base, still unresolved and causing friction with Washington over Chinese influence in the Indian Ocean.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#bb1919">B</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">BBC World <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@BBCWorld</div><p class="tweet-text">Andy Burnham becomes UK PM, facing early pressure over the unresolved Chagos base deal and US-China tensions in the Indian Ocean.</p><div class="tweet-meta">Aug 25 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/BBCWorld" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>The new cabinet pledged to prioritise the economy and housing, but foreign policy already tops the agenda.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Jul 20 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Burnham takes office</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Starmer</div><div class="stat-label">Predecessor (Labour)</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Chagos</div><div class="stat-label">First challenge</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">US-UK</div><div class="stat-label">Disputed base</div></div></div><p>Analysts say the Chagos decision will define Britain's ties with the US administration.</p><p>With information from: SCMP and Reuters.</p>`,
    date: '2026-08-25',
    readTimeEs: '5 min',
    readTimeEn: '5 min',
    imageUrl: '/images/blog/reino-unido-chagos-burnham-primer-ministro-2026.jpg',
    imageCaption: 'Andy Burnham. Fuente: Wikimedia Commons.',
    categoryEs: 'Mundo',
