    slug: 'espana-campeon-mundial-futbol-2026-final-argentina',
    titleEs: `EspaÃ±a se corona campeona del mundo al batir a Argentina en la final de 2026`,
    titleEn: `Spain crowned world champion after beating Argentina in 2026 final`,
    excerptEs: `La selecciÃ³n espaÃ±ola venciÃ³ 1-0 en tiempo extra a Argentina el 19 de julio en Nueva York; Inglaterra quedÃ³ tercera.`,
    excerptEn: `Spain beat Argentina 1-0 in extra time on Jul 19 in New York; England finished third.`,
    contentEs: `<p class="lead"><em>EspaÃ±a conquistÃ³ la Copa del Mundo de la FIFA 2026 al derrotar 1-0 a Argentina en tiempo extra el 19 de julio en Nueva York, segÃºn <em>Britannica</em> y la FIFA.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="/images/blog/espana-campeon-mundial-futbol-2026-final-argentina.jpg" alt="Seleccion nacional de futbol de Espana." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Seleccion nacional de futbol de Espana.</figcaption></figure><p>Inglaterra ocupÃ³ el tercer lugar tras vencer a Francia 6-4 en la disputa por el bronce.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#3268a8">F</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">FIFA World Cup <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@FIFAWorldCup</div><p class="tweet-text">Spain are champions of the FIFA World Cup 2026, beating Argentina 1-0 after extra time in New York. England take third.</p><div class="tweet-meta">25 ago 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/FIFAWorldCup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>El torneo, organizado por CanadÃ¡, MÃ©xico y Estados Unidos, cerrÃ³ con rÃ©cord de asistencia y consolidÃ³ a una generaciÃ³n espaÃ±ola bajo el mismo estilo de posesiÃ³n que su tÃ­tulo de 2010.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">1-0</div><div class="stat-label">Final vs Argentina (a.e.)</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">19 jul 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Fecha de la final</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">3er</div><div class="stat-label">Inglaterra (bronze)</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">3 paÃ­ses</div><div class="stat-label">Sede: CAN-MEX-EE. UU.</div></div></div><p>La celebraciÃ³n en Madrid reuniÃ³ a millones de aficionados.</p><p>Con informaciÃ³n de: Britannica y FIFA.</p>`,
    contentEn: `<p class="lead"><em>Spain won the 2026 FIFA World Cup by defeating Argentina 1-0 in extra time on 19 July in New York, according to <em>Britannica</em> and FIFA.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70" alt="2026 World Cup final (illustrative image)." loading="lazy"><figcaption>2026 World Cup final (illustrative image).</figcaption></figure><p>England took third place after beating France 6-4 in the bronze match.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#3268a8">F</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">FIFA World Cup <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@FIFAWorldCup</div><p class="tweet-text">Spain are champions of the FIFA World Cup 2026, beating Argentina 1-0 after extra time in New York. England take third.</p><div class="tweet-meta">Aug 25 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/FIFAWorldCup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>The tournament, hosted by Canada, Mexico and the United States, closed with record attendance and cemented a Spanish generation built on the possession style of their 2010 title.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">1-0</div><div class="stat-label">Final vs Argentina (a.e.)</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Jul 19 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Final date</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">3rd</div><div class="stat-label">England (bronze)</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">3 hosts</div><div class="stat-label">CAN-MEX-USA</div></div></div><p>Madrid celebrated with millions of fans.</p><p>With information from: Britannica and FIFA.</p>`,
    date: '2026-08-25',
    readTimeEs: '5 min',
    readTimeEn: '5 min',
    imageUrl: '/images/blog/espana-campeon-mundial-futbol-2026-final-argentina.jpg',
    imageCaption: 'Seleccion nacional de futbol de Espana. Fuente: Wikimedia Commons.',
