    excerptEn: `Sinner beat Zverev on Jul 12; Linda Moskova won her first Grand Slam; Pogacar won the Tour on Jul 26 for a fifth time.`,
    contentEs: `<p class="lead"><em>Jannik Sinner retuvo el tÃ­tulo de Wimbledon el 12 de julio de 2026 al vencer a Alexander Zverev, mientras Linda Moskova conquistÃ³ su primer Grand Slam, segÃºn <em>Britannica</em>.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70" alt="Wimbledon 2026 (imagen ilustrativa)." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Wimbledon 2026 (imagen ilustrativa).</figcaption></figure><p>En ciclismo, Tadej Pogacar ganÃ³ el Tour de Francia el 26 de julio por quinta vez, empatando rÃ©cords histÃ³ricos de campeonatos.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#007233">W</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">Wimbledon <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@Wimbledon</div><p class="tweet-text">Sinner retains the title, beating Zverev; Moskova claims her first Grand Slam. A landmark summer of sport in 2026.</p><div class="tweet-meta">25 ago 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/Wimbledon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>Ambos resultados consolidan a una nueva generaciÃ³n de dominadores en tenis y ciclismo.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">12 jul 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Sinner retiene Wimbledon</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">26 jul 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Pogacar 5Âº Tour</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">1er</div><div class="stat-label">Grand Slam de Moskova</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">5Ã—</div><div class="stat-label">TÃ­tulos del Tour (Pogacar)</div></div></div><p>Las federaciones destacan el rÃ©cord de audiencia global de ambos eventos.</p><p>Con informaciÃ³n de: Britannica.</p>`,
    contentEn: `<p class="lead"><em>Jannik Sinner retained the Wimbledon title on 12 July 2026 by beating Alexander Zverev, while Linda Moskova claimed her first Grand Slam, according to <em>Britannica</em>.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="/images/blog/deportes-2026-sinner-wimbledon-pogacar-tour-francia.jpg" alt="Jannik Sinner." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Jannik Sinner.</figcaption></figure><p>In cycling, Tadej Pogacar won the Tour de France on 26 July for a fifth time, tying historic championship records.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#007233">W</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">Wimbledon <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@Wimbledon</div><p class="tweet-text">Sinner retains the title, beating Zverev; Moskova claims her first Grand Slam. A landmark summer of sport in 2026.</p><div class="tweet-meta">Aug 25 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/Wimbledon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>Both results cement a new generation of dominators in tennis and cycling.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Jul 12 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Sinner retains Wimbledon</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Jul 26 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Pogacar 5th Tour</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">1st</div><div class="stat-label">Moskova Grand Slam</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">5Ã—</div><div class="stat-label">Tour titles (Pogacar)</div></div></div><p>Federations highlight record global viewership for both events.</p><p>With information from: Britannica.</p>`,
