    slug: 'papa-leon-xiv-lampedusa-migrantes-2026',
    titleEs: `El papa LeÃ³n XIV visita Lampedusa y recuerda a los migrantes desaparecidos en el mar`,
    titleEn: `Pope Leo XIV visits Lampedusa and remembers migrants lost at sea`,
    excerptEs: `El 4 de julio, el pontÃ­fice declarÃ³ que los muertos en el MediterrÃ¡neo son vÃ­ctimas de decisiones tomadas y omitidas; la OIM publicÃ³ cifras el 12 de agosto.`,
    excerptEn: `On Jul 4 the pontiff said those lost at sea are victims of decisions made and omitted; IOM published figures on Aug 12.`,
    contentEs: `<p class="lead"><em>El papa LeÃ³n XIV visitÃ³ Lampedusa el 4 de julio de 2026 y afirmÃ³ que los migrantes desaparecidos en el mar son "vÃ­ctimas tanto de las decisiones que se tomaron como de las que no se tomaron", segÃºn <em>Vatican News</em> y EWTN.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70" alt="Lampedusa, umbral del MediterrÃ¡neo (imagen ilustrativa)." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Lampedusa, umbral del MediterrÃ¡neo (imagen ilustrativa).</figcaption></figure><p>El viaje cobra nueva relevancia tras el informe de la OIM del 12 de agosto, que documenta el aumento de muertes en las rutas mediterrÃ¡neas durante 2026.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#c8102e">V</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">Vatican News <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@VaticanNews</div><p class="tweet-text">Pope Leo XIV in Lampedusa: those lost at sea are victims of decisions made and not made. His July 4 visit echoes the IOM Aug 12 report.</p><div class="tweet-meta">25 ago 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/VaticanNews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>El pontÃ­fice renovÃ³ el llamado de la Iglesia a la acogida y a rutas migratorias seguras.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">4 jul 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Visita del papa</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">12 ago 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Informe OIM</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Lampedusa</div><div class="stat-label">Umbral del MediterrÃ¡neo</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Vatican News</div><div class="stat-label">Fuente</div></div></div><p>La visita reavivÃ³ el debate europeo sobre la polÃ­tica migratoria.</p><p>Con informaciÃ³n de: Vatican News y EWTN.</p>`,
    contentEn: `<p class="lead"><em>Pope Leo XIV visited Lampedusa on 4 July 2026 and said migrants lost at sea are "victims both of decisions that were made and of decisions that were not made," according to <em>Vatican News</em> and EWTN.</em></p><figure class="report-figure"><img src="/images/blog/papa-leon-xiv-lampedusa-migrantes-2026.jpg" alt="Papa Leon XIV." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Papa Leon XIV.</figcaption></figure><p>The trip gains new weight after the IOM report of 12 August documenting rising Mediterranean deaths in 2026.</p><div class="tweet-card"><div class="tweet-avatar" style="background:#c8102e">V</div><div class="tweet-body"><div class="tweet-name">Vatican News <span class="tweet-verified" title="Cuenta verificada">&#10004;</span></div><div class="tweet-handle">@VaticanNews</div><p class="tweet-text">Pope Leo XIV in Lampedusa: those lost at sea are victims of decisions made and not made. His July 4 visit echoes the IOM Aug 12 report.</p><div class="tweet-meta">Aug 25 2026 &middot; <a href="https://x.com/VaticanNews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver en X &#8594;</a></div></div></div><p>The pontiff renewed the Church's call for welcome and safe migration routes.</p><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Jul 4 2026</div><div class="stat-label">Papal visit</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Aug 12 2026</div><div class="stat-label">IOM report</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Lampedusa</div><div class="stat-label">Mediterranean threshold</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">Vatican News</div><div class="stat-label">Source</div></div></div><p>The visit revived the European debate on migration policy.</p><p>With information from: Vatican News and EWTN.</p>`,
    date: '2026-08-25',
    readTimeEs: '5 min',
    readTimeEn: '5 min',
